WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.357
Welcome. Before you answer anything, I want to show you how Mandarin works.

2
00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:16.143
Mandarin is a spoken language — in China and in Chinese communities around the world. More people speak it as a first language than any other on Earth.

3
00:00:16.143 --> 00:00:20.786
Tap to listen. Don't try to memorise it; just hear how it sounds.

4
00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:32.929
你好 is the writing, called hànzì. nǐ hǎo shows the pronunciation, and it is called pinyin. Hello is the meaning. Every new piece of Mandarin will carry those three layers.

5
00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:37.214
This is not scored. I only want to know whether that landed.

6
00:00:37.214 --> 00:00:45.500
You know what you're learning, and you've heard your first word. Now let's practise recognising 你好 when it shows up.
